" 1 Overview  2 Sites  3 VLANs  4 MACs  5 Log  6 Setup  7 Breakout  8 Settings   "
"┌ Settings (Enter: change, Up/Down: more) ─────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│This host              every setting here changes this site only              █"
"│  This site            heim                                                   █"
"│  Trunk                ens19                                                  █"
"│  Commit timeout       1m  (network default)                                  █"
"│  Path MTU check       every 5m  (network default)                            █"
"│  TCP MSS              from the path MTU                                      █"
"│  RPS transport        off                                                    █"
"│  RPS trunk            off                                                    █"
"│  Skip conntrack       client tunnels                                         █"
"│  Control port         51821 (UDP, TCP)  (network default)                    ║"
"│  Tunnel port          51822 (UDP)  (follows the control port)                ║"
"│Role and rights        read only here; Sites (2), e on a site changes them    ║"
"│  Role                 server (connected with the other servers)              ║"
"│  Clients              haus6                                                  ║"
"└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
" The interfaces that carry the VLANs to the switch or hypervisor (ports of br0; "
" Enter lists those of this host). Several act like switch ports, the first is   "
" the main port. The one the tunnels run over is marked.                         "
" Saved, a setting is applied at once; c keeps it, otherwise it is rolled back.  "
"                                                                                "
"                          1 blocked, 1 down (see 1)  draft: no changes  heim r7 "
